================================
TOKA BRAND DIRECTION
================================

TOKA is NOT a traditional Italian pizzeria brand.

The identity should feel:
- tribal
- urban
- youthful
- contemporary
- slightly raw
- bold
- warm
- playful
- independent

Avoid:
- Italian flags
- red/green Italian clichés
- rustic Tuscany aesthetics
- vintage Italian restaurant styling
- excessive wood textures
- generic pizza-app appearance

Core concept:
"FEEL IT, YOU ARE PART OF THE TRIBE"

The tribal identity should be noticeable but controlled.

Use tribal graphics as:
- thin separators
- bottom borders
- small symbols near headings
- packaging-inspired decorative strips
- subtle background patterns
- micro details

Do NOT cover the UI with tribal decoration.

The interface itself must remain clean and modern.

